  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"a5b75a7f-4c7d-46b3-bbe5-849bdd192f3b"],
 " is the parallel analogue of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["DiagramComposition",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->
    "paclet:Wolfram/DiagrammaticComputation/ref/DiagramComposition"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"18e4278f-7664-467c-a0ec-5fddafcaee95"],
 " (sequential). At the tensor level it corresponds to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["TensorProduct",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/TensorProduct"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "17622fb6-7f9b-4613-b6ea-708f693aa628"],
